---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
import { business } from '../data/site';
const breadcrumbs=[{label:'About Us',href:'/about/'}];
---
<BaseLayout title="About Talon Expeditions | Group Travel Planning Company" description="Talon Expeditions is a U.S.-based group travel planning company for private groups, clubs, communities, businesses, and active or experience-led trips worldwide." image={images.heroAlt} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <section class="av-inner-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.heroAlt}')`}><div class="shell"><h1>About Us</h1><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell av-about-intro"><div class="av-about-stats"><div class="av-about-stat"><strong>Private</strong><span>Group-first planning</span></div><div class="av-about-stat"><strong>Global</strong><span>Worldwide destinations</span></div><div class="av-about-stat"><strong>Active</strong><span>Experience-led travel</span></div></div><div class="av-about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Who We Are</p><h2>Group Travel Built Around the People Doing the Traveling</h2><p>Talon Expeditions is a U.S.-based travel brand operated by Talon Global LLC. We help private groups, clubs, communities, businesses, and organizers design and coordinate supported trips worldwide, with particular strength in active travel, trekking, learn-to programs, culture, cruises, and journeys built around a shared interest.</p><p>The company exists because group travel becomes complicated in ways ordinary booking tools do not solve very well. A group needs more than a hotel and a flight. It needs a trip that fits the people, a workable size, clear activity expectations, rooming that makes sense, transport that connects, and information that reaches participants before it becomes urgent.</p><a class="button button-small" href="/why-talon/">Why Talon Expeditions</a></div><div class="av-about-portrait" style={`background-image:url('${images.coastalTraveler}')`}><div class="av-about-badge">Small groups. Big adventures.</div></div></div></section>
  <section class="av-mission-stage"><div class="shell av-mission-grid"><div class="av-mission-cards"><div class="av-mission-card featured"><h3>Our Mission</h3><p>Help groups create active, experience-led journeys with clearer planning, stronger organizer support, realistic traveler preparation, and destination-specific coordination.</p></div><div class="av-mission-card"><h3>Our Vision</h3><p>Support communities from the first trip idea through repeat programs, skill progression, annual club travel, and deeper destination experiences over time.</p></div><div class="av-mission-card"><h3>Operating Principle</h3><p>The difficult parts should become more organized as the trip develops. Travelers should arrive understanding what they are doing, what they need, and who is supporting them.</p></div></div><div class="av-mission-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Mission & Vision</p><h2>Good Travel Should Be Easier to Organize Without Becoming Generic.</h2><p>Talon Expeditions grew from a broader Talon ecosystem spanning travel, sports, digital operations, and international work. That background shaped a practical view of travel: the experience matters, but the systems behind it matter too.</p><p>The brand initially leaned more heavily into traditional adventure travel. The current direction is broader. We still plan demanding trips, but we also work with beginner-friendly groups, cultural travelers, cruise communities, wellness groups, businesses, and people who want movement and experience without turning the vacation into a test of identity.</p><div class="av-mission-values"><div class="av-mission-value"><h3>Clarity Beats Hype</h3><p>Describe the real trip, real difficulty, real inclusions, and real decisions people need to make.</p></div><div class="av-mission-value"><h3>Local Knowledge Matters</h3><p>Use destination and activity specialists where their qualifications and local capability add value.</p></div><div class="av-mission-value"><h3>Groups Are Not Averages</h3><p>Age, fitness, skill, budget, social dynamics, and travel experience vary inside one community.</p></div><div class="av-mission-value"><h3>Preparation Is Part of Travel</h3><p>Documents, equipment, fitness, rooming, arrivals, and expectations should not wait until the last week.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="av-services-intro"><p class="eyebrow">What We Plan</p><h2>A Broad Range of Trips, With a Deliberately Clear Operating Idea</h2><p>The common thread is supported travel built around a specific group, a specific reason to go, and a practical planning relationship.</p></div><div class="av-team-grid"><a class="av-team-card" href="/trekking-active-travel/" style={`background-image:url('${images.trekking}')`}><div class="av-team-label"><strong>Trekking & Active Travel</strong><span>Trails, mountains, movement</span></div></a><a class="av-team-card" href="/learn-to-trips/" style={`background-image:url('${images.surf}')`}><div class="av-team-label"><strong>Learn-To Travel</strong><span>Travel built around a skill</span></div></a><a class="av-team-card" href="/cultural-cruise-travel/" style={`background-image:url('${images.culture}')`}><div class="av-team-label"><strong>Culture & Cruise</strong><span>Discovery, coastlines, connection</span></div></a><a class="av-team-card" href="/private-group-travel/" style={`background-image:url('${images.group}')`}><div class="av-team-label"><strong>Private Groups</strong><span>Trips shaped around your community</span></div></a><a class="av-team-card" href="/experiences/" style={`background-image:url('${images.wildlife}')`}><div class="av-team-label"><strong>Wildlife & Nature</strong><span>Experience-led journeys</span></div></a><a class="av-team-card" href="/group-travel/wellness-yoga/" style={`background-image:url('${images.lake}')`}><div class="av-team-label"><strong>Active Rest</strong><span>Movement without performance theater</span></div></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="av-why-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">Travel-industry infrastructure</p><h2>Professional Systems Behind a Flexible Trip</h2></div><p>Talon Expeditions operates as {business.legalName} and uses travel-industry credentials, supplier relationships, and destination partners appropriate to the trip. Specific supplier relationships vary by itinerary.</p></div><div class="av-why-image" style={`background-image:url('${images.boat}')`}></div><div class="av-why-grid"><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>CLIA</h3><span class="num">01</span></div><p>Cruise-industry infrastructure and relationships relevant to hosted cruise and marine travel.</p></div><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>IATA</h3><span class="num">02</span></div><p>Air-travel industry infrastructure supporting the broader travel planning model.</p></div><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>ARC</h3><span class="num">03</span></div><p>U.S. travel-industry infrastructure supporting booking and agency operations.</p></div><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>Talon Group</h3><span class="num">04</span></div><p>A wider international operating ecosystem that supports the brand without changing its group-first travel focus.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="av-proof-band" style={`background-image:url('${images.wildlife}')`}><div class="shell"><div class="av-proof-head"><p class="eyebrow">The Operating Idea</p><h2>Travel can be personal without being improvised.</h2></div><div class="av-proof-grid"><div class="av-proof-card"><h3>Group-first</h3><p>The organizer, traveler mix, pace, purpose, and support expectations shape the trip from the beginning.</p><small>Private group planning</small></div><div class="av-proof-card"><h3>Experience-led</h3><p>The itinerary should protect what the group came to do, learn, or experience rather than simply maximize stops.</p><small>Trip design</small></div><div class="av-proof-card"><h3>Operationally clear</h3><p>Suppliers, specialists, participant responsibilities, and preparation should become more explicit as departure approaches.</p><small>Supported travel</small></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
